    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present to the market this beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom bungalow which boasts panoramic vistas across the Atlantic Ocean to the Clare coastline. This light-filled house makes the most of the views on offer with a large bay window in the kitchen providing the perfect location to enjoy the views. \nSituated on a large plot, the property features lawns to the front and rear and a mature hedgerow for added privacy. The large rear lawn offers a secure, private haven for children to play, avid gardeners to cultivate, or for hosting summer barbecues. \nWhile enjoying a peaceful rural serenity, convenience is right on your doorstep. The property is located a short drive to the vibrant village of Ballyduff ensuring easy access to school, local shops, pharmacy, pubs etc. Kilmore beach is just 1.9km away while the blue flag beaches of Ballybunion and world renowned links at Ballybunion Golf Club are just a 15 minute drive. \nAccommodation comprises: entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining room, utility, three double bedrooms (master with ensuite) and a family bathroom. \nViewing of this property is a must and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.57m x 1.50m\nwith tiled floor and uPVC door with glazed side panels.\n\nLiving Room - 4.72m x 3.28m\nwith open fire place with a wooden surround, oak flooring and window with sea views.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 7.35m x 3.61m\nA light filled room with dual aspect, this room is truly the heart of the home with a fitted kitchen, ceramic floor tiles, stove, patio door to side and a bay window which enjoys views over the Atlantic and to the Clare coastline\n\nUtility Room - 2.26m x 1.65m\nwith fitted units, ceramic floor tiles, plumbed for appliances and door to rear garden.\n\nBedroom corridor - 8.40m x 1.02m\nwith ceramic floor tiles, stira to attic.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.01m x 3.27m\nDouble with fitted units, laminate flooring & window.\n\nEnsuite - 1.95m x 1.16m\nwith an electric shower, whb, w/c, wall & floor tiles and window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.38m x 2.78m\nDouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.03m x 2.76m\nDouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.75m x 2.07m\nwith w/c, whb, bath, and separate Triton T90si electric shower, wall and floor tiles & window.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bed, 2 bathroom bungalow in turn key condition.</li><li>Stunning views over the Atlantic and Clare Coastline</li><li>Large 0.54 acre site with lawns to the front and rear.</li><li>Mature hedge to the side and rear boundaries. </li><li>Stira to attic which is floored & has two velux windows.</li><li>Oil fired and solid fuel heating</li><li>Onsite septic tank & Mains Water Supply</li><li>Just a 5 minute drive to the large village Ballyduff with shops, bars, pharmacy & school.</li><li>Ballybunion Golf Club and Blue Flag Beaches are 15 minute drive</ul>"
      },
      {
